{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26691","headline":"寄题蔡州蒋亭兼简田使君 · 姚合","name":"寄题蔡州蒋亭兼简田使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几岁乱军里，蒋亭名不销。\n无人知旧径，有药长新苗。\n树宿山禽静，池通野水遥。\n何因同此醉，永望思萧条。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}